                "The\nIliad of Homer\n\nTranslated by\nAlexander Pope,\n\nWith Notes and Introduction\nby the\nRev. Theodore Alois Buckley, M.A., F.S.A.\n\nand\nFlaxman\u2019s Designs.\n\n1899\n\nContents\n\nINTRODUCTION.\n POPE\u2019S PREFACE TO THE ILIAD OF HOMER\n\nTHE ILIAD"
